# `rtok agents show` (T284): an id prefix no agent has → exit 1. The success/`--json`
# path is not deterministic here (fresh UUIDs and timestamps per run) and is covered by
# `tests/agents.rs` instead.

```console
$ HOME=target/tmp/t284-show RTOK_HOME=target/tmp/t284-show rtok agents show ffff
? 1
Error: no agent id starts with "ffff"

```
